                    <button class="fee-tab px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-sm text-slate-400 border-b-2 border-transparent whitespace-nowrap transition hover:text-slate-600" data-tab="stats"><i class="fas fa-chart-pie mr-1.5"></i>Fee Structure Stats</button>
