// Version: 9.0 - FIXED: Proper amount handling, no auto-fallback to maxCash
// - Cash amounts: EXACTLY what the user enters
// - Item quantities: EXACTLY what the user enters
// - No automatic conversion or fallback to max values
// - Proper validation before submission
// - Clear logging for debugging

// ========== SUBMIT PERIOD PAYMENT (COMPLETE REBUILD v11.0) ==========
